You have learned to create and equip specialist ammunition:

Incendiary - Shots deal an additional [23%, 28%, 33%, 36%, 40% (TL1-5)] weapon damage as fire in a radius [1, 1, 2, 2, 2 (TL1-5)] ball. This cannot occur more than once per turn.

Venomous - Shots deal [22, 29, 35, 40, 44 (TL1-5; PP 100)] nature damage and inflict numbing poison, dealing a further [108, 146, 175, 200, 222 (TL1-5; PP 100)] nature damage over 5 turns and reducing all damage dealt by [8%, 12%, 15%, 16%, 18% (TL1-5)].

Piercing - Shots reduce armor and saves by [0, 11, 17, 20, 22 (TL1-5)] for 3 turns, and your physical penetration is increased by [7%, 14%, 17%, 20%, 22% (TL1-5)].

You can only have 1 type of ammunition loaded at a time.

The poison damage dealt, armor penetration and save reduction will increase with your Physical Power.
